  "raw_response": "def solve(grid):\n    # Find the minimal bounding box that contains all non\u2011zero cells\n    rows = len(grid)\n    if rows == 0:\n        return []\n    cols = len(grid[0]) if grid[0] else 0\n\n    min_r = max_r = min_c = max_c = None\n\n    for i in range(rows):\n        for j in range(cols):\n            if grid[i][j] != 0:\n                if min_r is None or i < min_r:\n                    min_r = i\n                if max_r is None or i > max_r:\n                    max_r = i\n                if min_c is None or j < min_c:\n                    min_c = j\n                if max_c is None or j > max_c:\n                    max_c = j\n\n    # If there is no non\u2011zero cell, return an empty grid\n    if min_r is None:\n        return []\n\n    # Extract the sub\u2011grid defined by the bounding box\n    subgrid = [grid[i][min_c:max_c + 1] for i in range(min_r, max_r + 1)]\n\n    # Horizontally flip (mirror) each row\n    transformed = [row[::-1] for row in subgrid]\n\n    return transformed",
  "script": "def solve(grid):\n    # Find the minimal bounding box that contains all non\u2011zero cells\n    rows = len(grid)\n    if rows == 0:\n        return []\n    cols = len(grid[0]) if grid[0] else 0\n\n    min_r = max_r = min_c = max_c = None\n\n    for i in range(rows):\n        for j in range(cols):\n            if grid[i][j] != 0:\n                if min_r is None or i < min_r:\n                    min_r = i\n                if max_r is None or i > max_r:\n                    max_r = i\n                if min_c is None or j < min_c:\n                    min_c = j\n                if max_c is None or j > max_c:\n                    max_c = j\n\n    # If there is no non\u2011zero cell, return an empty grid\n    if min_r is None:\n        return []\n\n    # Extract the sub\u2011grid defined by the bounding box\n    subgrid = [grid[i][min_c:max_c + 1] for i in range(min_r, max_r + 1)]\n\n    # Horizontally flip (mirror) each row\n    transformed = [row[::-1] for row in subgrid]\n\n    return transformed",
